  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&#x2019;s Integrated Sexual Health 2 (ACTION): Chama cha Uzazi na Malezi Bora Tanzania (Tanzania)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Chama cha Uzazi na Malezi Bora Tanzania, the IPPF Member Association in Tanzania, is a locally owned Non-Governmental Organization providing quality integrated SRHR information, products and services. In the WISH2ACTION project, the organization gives priority to underserved women and girls including but not limited to youth under the age of 20, those living in poverty, and those living in disability.</narrative>
  </description>
